      "text": "Blue = TUI process (Rust + ratatui, prebuilt binary, ADR-0002)\nOrange = scanner process (bash, the only frontmatter parser and rule set, ADR-0006)\nRed = the write does not happen; disk is untouched\nDescribes commit d056a0f. Regenerate when the write path changes.",
